3. The "Beacon Registry" (P2P Images)
Since Project Beacon is about connectivity, you could create a P2P Image Store.

The Idea: If one user has "Minecraft 1.20.1 + 50 Mods" already set up, another user can "pull" that exact environment directly from them.
The Tech: Use your Rust backend to compress the instance folder into a .tar.zst and send it over your Cloudflare tunnel.

